{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["<b>And take a fifth of the land of Egypt.</b> He should command that they collect a fifth of all the grain for the king's needs, even though in other years his due is a tithe, as it is written: ״ואת שדותיכם יעשור״ (and he shall tithe your fields). Now he will take two tithes, and so he did, as it is written: ״על אדמת מצרים לחומש״."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:08:15.307686712Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}